# Data License — Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0

## What this covers

Every dataset Norimichi produces or redistributes, including but not limited
to:

  * `app/public/data/**` — the GeoJSON layers the frontend reads
    (segments, corridors, cycleways, hexes, schools, stations, access
    surfaces, and any other exported layer)
  * `pipeline/output/**` — GeoPackages and intermediate tables
  * any extract, tile set, or dump derived from the above

